{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51907","headline":"摄中郎将作诗（在省日，宣宗顾问称旨，摄中郎将，有诗曰：〖见下〗风神後迈。後拥节旄。） · 无名氏","name":"摄中郎将作诗（在省日，宣宗顾问称旨，摄中郎将，有诗曰：〖见下〗风神後迈。後拥节旄。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宫娃引入玉爲行，金殿齐趋近御牀。\n不见圣明亲顾问，如何得摄汉中郎？\n（以上《诗话总龟》二三《寓情门》引《南部新书》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}